18:T6f9,IOMechs is hiring an experienced Upwork Bidder (𝐎𝐧-𝐒𝐢𝐭𝐞) with a strong focus on the 𝑾𝒆𝒃𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑴𝒐𝒃𝒊𝒍𝒆 𝑨𝒑𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒄𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑫𝒆𝒗𝒆𝒍𝒐𝒑𝒎𝒆𝒏𝒕 niche.

𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐩𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐞𝐬:
 • Write tailored, high-converting proposals aligned with client needs
 • Hunt down and bid on high-potential 𝑾𝒆𝒃𝒔𝒊𝒕𝒆 & 𝑴𝒐𝒃𝒊𝒍𝒆 𝑨𝒑𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒄𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏 projects
 • Maintain active communication with potential clients and follow up consistently
 • Coordinate with internal teams to ensure project requirements are well-defined in proposals
 • Build and manage a pipeline of leads and opportunities
 • Analyze market trends and competitor activity to refine bidding strategies
 • Maintain and optimize the company’s Upwork profile for visibility and credibility

𝐑𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐫𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐬:
 • Target: $5𝐊 - $10𝐊
 • Proven experience of 2-4 𝐲𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐬 as an Upwork bidder and freelancer in the Website and Mobile Application Development.
 • Experience with Upwork platform management and optimization
 • Proficiency in creating and submitting proposals on Upwork
 • Experience in client handling, negotiation, and closing deals

𝐋𝐨𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧: Karachi (On-Site)

𝐖𝐡𝐚𝐭 𝐰𝐞’𝐫𝐞 𝐨𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐢𝐧𝐠:
- Market Competitive Salary
- Medical Allowance
- ⁠Performance-Based Rewards
- ⁠Global Project Exposure
- ⁠Opportunities for learning and growth

Interested candidates can apply at careers@iomechs.com mentioning the position in the subject line.19:T5c8,Job Title: ACCA Accountant 
Job Type: Full or Part Time,
Flexible Pay: PKR 40,000 to 70,000 per month depending on experience and qualification Work
Location: Remote/Work from home  
We are a firm of Chartered Accountants based in the UK and are looking for self-motivated, passionate Accountant with first class interpersonal skills to join the team. This is an excellent opportunity for career progression and could grow into a senior level role over the next 2-3 years.  
Responsibility And Duties   
* Preparation of statutory accounts, Profit & Loss and Balance Sheet, for sole traders, partnerships and SME’s 
* Bookkeeping on accountancy software and preparation of quarterly VAT preparation for clients 
* Preparation and Submission of corporation and personal tax returns (self-employed, employed, UK property, non-resident landlord, CGT and others.
* Preparation of monthly management information, including budgets, cash flow statements and other reports as required, control account reconciliations  Skills And Requirements   
* ACCA Qualified or Part-Qualified (Professional level student) 
* Recent Experience is preferable 
* Good IT skills 
* Self-motivated and able to work with team members and to deadlines 
* Excellent analytical, communication and interpersonal skills are essential
 • Good in English speaking and writing
 • Efficient in using MS Excel & MS Word  
If you are interested, please send your CV to furquan.ali@capshire.com1b:T6d6,Bank AL Habib is looking for a Branch Manager.

Eligibility Criteria
Qualification:
Minimum Bachelor's (Preferably Master's)

Department: Retail Banking

Experience: 3 years as a Branch Manager

Job Requirements & Responsibilities: 
- To develop new business avenues for the growth of Branch Business and to excel in the development of Bank Asset and Liability Products.
- To maintain liaison with Corporate Institutions, Multinational Companies, Government Institutions, and other important Account Holders of the Branch. 
- To market NTBs, meet business targets, guidance to BDBs.
- To administer sales, services, operational efficiency, and HR management activities to meet Bank objectives and the achievement of the branch key targets given by the Management. 
- Further ensure that staff will work on the conversion of COC and Marketing through cash counter and utility bills.
- To bear responsibility for branch Deposit mobilization, Credit targets, Account Opening, and Other KPI’s.
- To achieve the month-on-month deposit and targets assigned to the branch.
- Staff management with respect to the leaves, rotations, trainings, and performance reviews – solving their problems and encouraging their efforts.
- The Branch Manager should review all the compliance-related tasks performed by the Operations Manager.
- Monitoring/ensuring compliance with KYC and other requirements of regulatory bodies.
- Ensure that customer complaints are handled promptly and diligently.
- Make sure that customers are timely attended and their day-to-day problems/queries are resolved.

Location: Karachi, Lahore, Hyderabad, Sukkur

Interested candidates may apply online through https://lnkd.in/gH9xc4YE
By September 21st, 20251c:T551,We’re Hiring at Devflovv – Browser Extension Developer

📍 Location: Raiwind Road, Lahore | 🕒 Timings: 6:00 PM – 3:00 AM | 💼 Full-time

Devflovv is on the lookout for a Browser Extension Developer who’s passionate about building smart, scalable, and high-performing extensions. If you love React, thrive on solving problems, and have hands-on experience with Manifest V2/V3, background/service workers, content scripts, and messaging, we’d love to meet you!

What You’ll Do
>Build and maintain Chrome/Edge/Firefox extensions (Manifest V2/V3).
>Develop and optimize background/service workers & content scripts.
>Design sleek and functional UI with React & CSS.
>Ensure secure, reliable, and cross-browser compatibility.
>Collaborate with the team to ship innovative extension features.

What We’re Looking For
>2+ years of experience in browser extension development.
>Strong command of React, CSS, Manifest V2/V3.
>Proven knowledge of background/service workers, messaging, and content scripts.
>Ability to debug, test, and optimize for performance.
>Detail-oriented with a problem-solving mindset.

Why Devflovv?
>Work with a forward-thinking, collaborative team.
>Competitive salary & perks.
>Growth opportunities with global projects.
>In-house meal.

